            "review_title": "Review at Mon Hue Restaurant",
            "review_text": "David D\n1 contribution\n0\nAvoid\nOct 2019 • Family\nBeware and avoid!! Restaurant is well located and clean and staff were friendly. But that is probably all that is good. Half the menu is blanked off and unavailable and the half that was available we managed to order 6 dishes. After a few minutes waiter comes back to tell us another 1 was then unavailable to which we changed to something else. A few minutes later after our drinks come out we were told yet another was unavailable. Of the total 6 we only manged to get 3 after one change. From there service went down hill. Also looked like we weren't the only ones that had that problem as a few other tables were told the same as well.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 12, 2019",
